## {m.dialog_usage_title()}

```svelte
<script>
  import {
    Dialog,
    DialogTrigger,
    DialogSurface,
    DialogTitle,
    DialogContent,
    DialogActions,
    Button
  } from 'fluentui-svelte';

  let dialog = $state();
</script>

<Dialog bind:this={dialog}>
  <DialogTrigger>Open Dialog</DialogTrigger>
  <DialogSurface>
    <DialogTitle>Dialog Title</DialogTitle>
    <DialogContent>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit.</p>
    </DialogContent>
    <DialogActions fluid>
      <Button>Save</Button>
      <Button appearance="standard" onclick={() => dialog.closeDialog()}>Close</Button>
    </DialogActions>
  </DialogSurface>
</Dialog>
```

## {m.dialog_dialog_props_title()}

| **Name**       | **Type**                                  | **Description**                                              |
| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| `type`         | `'modal'` &vert; `'non-modal'` &vert; `'alert'` | {m.dialog_props_type_description()}    |
| `open`         | bindable `boolean`                        | {m.dialog_props_open_description()}                                 |
| `onOpenChange` | `(open: boolean) => void`                 | {m.dialog_props_onopenchange_description()}             |
| `children`     | `Snippet`                                 | {m.dialog_props_children_description()}                        |

## {m.dialog_dialogtrigger_props_title()}

| **Name**    | **Type**             | **Description**                                            |
| ----------- | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| `ref`       | `HTMLButtonElement`  | {m.dialog_props_ref_description()}                  |
| `children`  | `Snippet`            | {m.dialog_props_trigger_children_description()}                        |
| ...ButtonProps | `ButtonProps<'button'>` | {m.dialog_props_buttonprops_description()}                        |

## {m.dialog_dialogsurface_props_title()}

| **Name**      | **Type**                            | **Description**                                       |
| ------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| `ref`         | bindable `HTMLDialogElement`        | {m.dialog_props_surface_ref_description()}              |
| `children`    | `Snippet`                           | {m.dialog_props_surface_children_description()}      |
| ...Attributes | `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDialogElement>` | {m.dialog_props_surface_attributes_description()}       |

## {m.dialog_dialogtitle_props_title()}

| **Name**      | **Type**                            | **Description**                                          |
| ------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| `as`          | `'div'` &vert; `'h1'`–`'h6'`        | {m.dialog_props_as_description()}       |
| `ref`         | bindable element                    | {m.dialog_props_title_ref_description()}                  |
| `children`    | `Snippet`                           | {m.dialog_props_title_children_description()}                                       |
| ...Attributes | Polymorphic                         | {m.dialog_props_title_attributes_description()} |

## {m.dialog_dialogcontent_props_title()}

| **Name**      | **Type**                         | **Description**                                     |
| ------------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `ref`         | `HTMLDivElement`                 | {m.dialog_props_content_ref_description()}           |
| `children`    | `Snippet`                        | {m.dialog_props_content_children_description()}       |
| ...Attributes | `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>` | {m.dialog_props_content_attributes_description()}        |

## {m.dialog_dialogactions_props_title()}

| **Name**      | **Type**                            | **Description**                                          |
| ------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| `ref`         | bindable `HTMLDivElement`           | {m.dialog_props_actions_ref_description()}                |
| `position`    | `'start'` &vert; `'center'` &vert; `'end'` | {m.dialog_props_position_description()} |
| `fluid`       | `boolean`                           | {m.dialog_props_fluid_description()}  |
| `children`    | `Snippet`                           | {m.dialog_props_actions_children_description()}        |
| ...Attributes | `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`    | {m.dialog_props_actions_attributes_description()}             |
